en":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["民事诉讼法第六十六条把物证、视听资料和电子数据都列为证据。最高人民法院的证据规定第十四条把图片、音频、视频列为电子数据。第十五条要求交电子数据的原件，拿录像当证据要交原始载体。照片和录像能把马上会变的现场状态留下来，再和报警记录、维修记录、病历、证人说法互相对上。「全景、位置、细节」这个顺序是经验做法，法律没有规定（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2023 年修正，2024 年 1 月 1 日施行). 民事诉讼法（第六十六条）. 上海市发展和改革委员会转载全文 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/ys-syjf-zc-2.4.1-h5/20240408/073febdb2b04464390546232d4089f51.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/ys-syjf-zc-2.4.1-h5/20240408/073febdb2b04464390546232d4089f51.html"]},"；最高人民法院 (2019 年修正). 关于民事诉讼证据的若干规定（第十四、十五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/212721.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/212721.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/ys-syjf-zc-2.4.1-h5/20240408/073febdb2b04464390546232d4089f51.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-r